WEBVTT

00:35:27.496 --> 00:35:30.871
submit job after job after application
after application

00:35:30.871 --> 00:35:36.329
and would hear nothing. It took an entire
year to get a full time job.

00:35:37.079 --> 00:35:38.913
Everyone's face career turbulence.

00:35:39.454 --> 00:35:42.829
The current recession is jeopardizing
millions of careers right now.

00:35:43.538 --> 00:35:47.788
But we've been here before and there are
lessons we can learn from past recessions.